ith a little box  and he said then whatever i said yes sir  he said a little gift from the president  wow i said thank you and i opened it up  and there was a little note that said  having seen you play  i think you could use a few more golf  balls  and in it were three presidential white  house balls  so there are some tongue-in-cheek  remarks from presidents  so they add a little something to the  usual collection  yeah i'm looking through you're giving  up world series rings  um i don't know i might have to open up  the wallet here vin i  i would love to have the score card from  your final game but i saw where the  estimate is between 10 and 15  000 i you know i don't have  any idea i don't really want to know  until it's all over  that way i won't be falsely elated  and i won't be depressed i will just  gratefully take  whatever they give me and immediately  turn it over  we're also contributing some money to  ucla  especially for neuromuscular  the so-called lou gehrig's disease  and hopefully that'll help it kind of  ties me in  with the disease in baseball and also  i i don't know what that must have felt  like when you see all of your  memorabilia  carted away was there one item where you  said your wife you know what maybe i  should keep that  no i never did that but i'll tell you  the one  stroke of i don't know  memorabilia attack was i was watching  them load  the truck because everything went back  to philadelphia  for safekeeping anyway they were loading  the truck and i was watching  calmly no emotion and all of a sudden  they brought out my golf clubs and when  they put those left-handed golf clubs  in the truck i realized that was a major  portion of my life  i could hear the door slamming and see  the  the clubs go off into the future i think  that was the biggest twins that i had of  all  did you play augusta no  i broadcast augusta what would happen is  the sunday the ball would roll into the  cup  the crew cbs crew would have a party  and they would play monday with the  sunday pin placements  meanwhile i was fighting traffic on a  sunday night  getting back to the airport to fly  wherever the dodgers were  to pick up on the play for monday so i  never  played augusta even though i ached to  play there  and a couple of times i was invited to  play  but it just didn't work with my schedule  so the answer  is a resounding no but i did play saint  andrews  which was certainly a close second  van i hope you're well sounds like  you're doing well and sorry about your  golf clubs but uh hopefully you're able  to  raise some money there and also a  portion will go benefit the uh  neuromuscular research at ucla thanks  again for joining us  dan my pleasure to be with you thanks  for the opportunity and  talk to you again one day that's the  dodger hall of famer and uh  the live internet auction september 23rd  that's hunt h-u-n-t hunt auctions  a 67-year broadcasting career of in  sculling

